#: skylar_specs/suspension_explain/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's... not doing great."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/suspension_explain/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why would glasses have a suspension? Isn't that for cars?"
