msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Ah... you've done it. Biffed the whole wazoo."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/suspension_decide_bad/0/56
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "My Suspension of Disbelief, has been disbelieved."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/suspension_decide_bad/0/64
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Why do I even bother explaining things?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/suspension_decide_bad/0/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just think that lore should hold up to scrutiny."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/suspension_decide_bad/0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your lore sucks and you know it!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/suspension_decide_bad/0/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry Skylar... I didn't mean to hurt her."
