#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Anyway... Reggie...? I know you're always around, buddy..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A well-dressed figure saunters into the room, tossing his locs over his shoulder. He shoots you a look that sends a shiver straight through you, a smirk playing at his lips."
