#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's an aura of danger about him, as if he delights in the misfortune of others... and is eagerly anticipating yours."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/37
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "So, <i>this</i> is the grand lover I've been hearing about!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You've made quite the impression on us all."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's your deal?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have a lot of love to give!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Sorry if I don't believe your little game."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You're telling me you love <i>every</i> thing in this house? All of 'em?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I love everyone."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All of them."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hahaha! You've got a lot of nerve."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You've got everyone here fooled but me."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Pfft! You're so full of it!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Well, keep it to yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You want me to believe that you actually love everyone equally?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You'll have their hearts broken by next Tuesday!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's unfair!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I won't!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You know what's unfair? Dating a hundred of <w>anything</w> at the <w>same time</w>!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-0/c-4/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Yeah, alright."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Listen."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I know this is all a game to you, and I'm sure you've had a great time."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "But please, just be honest and this can all end."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm being honest."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trust me, I love everyone."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "How can you love this much? How can you have so much to give?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It doesn't make sense..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "...hm..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie idly twirls a loc around his finger, thinking."
