#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Next..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What does Cam give you after you finally break through his cold metal exterior?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An old cucumber."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A banana peel."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A day-old burrito that actually tasted pretty good!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Ok, that one was easy."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Really? Wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Come on. You could've at least guessed <i>something</i>. Wrong and disappointed."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Did you...? Never mind. Wrong."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Last..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What is one of Barry's fixations?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Peregrine falcons."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doves."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kestrels."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Toucans."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I have no words. Wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Couldn't be more wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "So so wrong."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love_reggie/0/g-5/c-20/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You know, it really does make sense."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie's nostrils flare with anger—he runs a hand through his hair, doing his best to seem unbothered."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/11
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Ok, so you got all of them right. Big whoop!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/19
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Doesn't mean you've won me over."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not trying to."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What? You're saying you <i>don't</i> find me irresistible?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Maybe I'm not wearing the right cologne..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're great just the way you are."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know you're just acting tough, but you're a softie."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You sound like a motivational speaker."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Wait, are you trying to hit on me?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to understand you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to meet the real you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-0/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Get in line."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-0/26/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Not a lot of people get to know me, but I like it like that. It's easier to handle."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-1/7 skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Who told you that?! Was it Betty?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-1/18
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "...ugh, yeah, I know. \"The rogue who is actually a softie\", a huge cliché."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-0/23/c-1/26 skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-1/15/g-0/19
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's easier, if you can believe that."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What do you mean understand? How could you possibly understand me?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know you're just acting tough."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really care about everyone here!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/c-1/15/g-0/11
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "...ugh, yeah, I know. \"The rogue is actually a softie\", a huge cliché."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Look, maybe you're not so bad. If my friends can love you then..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Maybe I can love you, too."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I promise I won't ever do anything to hurt you or them."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Don't get your hopes up too high, but yeah, maybe. Maybe I can pop in from time to time and check in, even if you don't get rejected."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_allcorrect/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Stick to that promise, and we'll be just fine."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie gives you a grin that makes you feel as if you've done something very, very wrong."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/11
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Just like I thought. You don't know shit!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Did you even try?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gave me hard questions!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This wasn't fair!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You said you loved everyone, so you should've been able to answer at least <i>three questions</i> about them... Right?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love isn't about answering random questions..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love has nothing to do with remembering little details like that!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hate you Reggie!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Yeah... yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Man."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie doubles over, his breath seeming to catch."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/33
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Reggie... you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/41
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "This just makes me so..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/52
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Happy!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/66
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I love it! Ha!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/77
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Love it?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/85
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Hell yeah! I love you, human!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/93
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You got all the way to almost a perfect score, then fucked it so hard right at the end..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/101
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I haven't laughed this hard in centuries!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/112
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Well, I guess I will <i>definitely</i> see you around. I'll watch you fail over, and over, and over."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/120
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Thanks... Reggie."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/128
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Oh man..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/reggie_wrong/0/g-1/136
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie wipes his tears, checking his mascara in a nearby mirror. He smiles wickedly at his own reflection."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/3
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I'm Reggie Repaired from now on. You have my Love."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! Score!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we just be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-0/10 skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-1/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Reggie takes your phone, typing something into it. He turns your phone back around to show you a funny little icon that looks like a broken heart."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Go on, be with the ones you love. I'll catch you later. On my app."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-1/7/b/1
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What the hell is wrong with you? 99 loves and one friend?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "What the hell is wrong with you? All these goddamn loves and just one friend?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Whatever. Free will gotta free will."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_reggie_love_join/0/c-1/33
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I'll catch you later. On my app."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar pulls her dateviators up for just a moment, peeking shyly without anything to separate you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/16
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/24
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You did it."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/32
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You've gotten all the other dateables to fall in love with you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/40
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm... just gobsmacked."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/48
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "And a little intimidated?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, it was nothing."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks! I'm really glad I did it!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just can't get enough..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It was everything! Literally!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You should be!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "There's always DLC..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Wait... you didn't... cheat in some way did you?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You don't seem like the kind of person who has magic time travel powers who can re-do encounters with objects..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Oh wait! I actually have a little doohickey that can check if you cheated in some way!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I've been told there's something humans do called \"save-scumming\" where they do a time-travel thing and I don't know how it works but I do remember it from some blog posts I found."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm going to use this gun on you now. It shouldn't hurt..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "...but it might."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar pulls a strange device from... well, you're not sure from where, really."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She points it at you. You find its drill-like shape deeply concerning."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't use that on me!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do your worst."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Why... You afraid...?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I will!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar fiddles with the strange device."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "All right... turning on... and..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She pulls the trigger."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/30
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Wow!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/52
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Looks like you didn't do that <w>at all</w>. Not once! You're one of the good ones!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup, that's me. Totally honest."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...great!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I love that for you!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "The best thing is this detector is foolproof, so it definitely would have known if you were lying."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Congratulations, you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-2/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Now get out there and Realize us! Or leave! Or... do whatever!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_final_love/0/g-2/23
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I love you!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/4
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "When Franklin Lieste made me - it was in sort of a mad, passionate rush of scientific fervor."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/12
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "There were... unintended consequences. Like Realization - which is a good thing."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it though?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, definitely."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Definitely a good thing pretty much."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "But one of the issues with Realizing an object is that each of us can only leave once our own little purposes are complete."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Some of us here still have Things To Do before we go."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I call it - \"Unfurnished Business.\""
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Clever!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's pretty lame, Skylar."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooof... that one hurts."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Thank you very much! It's trademarked."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Aw... I had like weeks to think about it and everything."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I know, but in a good way, right?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Each of us can't become a human if we have Unfurnished Business - reasons we need to appear in this house."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "None of the others know why exactly this is or what it might be that we need to do."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/16
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Oh, but I'll always tell you when I see it - and forbid you from Realizing that individual."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/24
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "As for me? Well. I have the most Unfurnished Business out of anyone."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/32
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I have to be here to help everyone else get Realized, so I gotta go last."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/40
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Sorry to be the bearer of bad news, but if you want me Realized, you have to get everyone else Realized too."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Darn."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay. I see now what my Quest is."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if I only want you to be Realized?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-5/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It might be a slog, but it'll be worth it!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-5/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Keep Realizing everyone you see - and eventually my Unfurnished Business will become Furnished!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-5/23
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Er. Oh, eh... Finished! Finished!!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-6/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You've got it! Keep Realizing everyone you see - and eventually my Unfurnished Business will become Furnished!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-6/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Er. Furnished, er, finished!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-7/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Well. I can do that. But it would mean you couldn't speak with anyone else in the house, for good."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-7/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "If you want that... then I can arrange it. Though I don't recommend it."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished_explain/0/skylar_ub_join/c-7/23
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See me later if that's what you want."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Hm.... Well, well, well..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/14
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I mean if anyone knows what's really going on, it's me."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/22
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You're not <i>really</i> more charming..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/30
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "But."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/38
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You used one of your rare candies on me..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/46
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Which means... you care."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do care!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're worth it, Skylar."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... sorta."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'll let that slide."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's all good in this hood."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_candy/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Let's be friends!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Did you Realize everyone? Are your SPECS enough?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_join/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, maybe not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_join/0/c-1/16 skylar_specs/skylar_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You know where to find me!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_join/0/c-1/24 skylar_specs/skylar_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Perched right on your nose."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_join/0/c-1/32
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "...right... here..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Sorry, but without Realizing everyone else you should really keep me here!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Otherwise it's basically game over. Hehehe."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want to talk to these freaking dateables anymore. There's too many of them."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've done all I can do with the amount of Hate endings I have..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right... I'll keep talking to these freaks."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/c-0/7 skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "All right... then let's get this started!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_unfurnished/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "A wise move!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Asking again? You ready this time?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "End of an era if you were."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got it on lock."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_begin/3
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Well. This time, let's do it right."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realize_begin/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through and around your dateviators, and what was once the dateviators themselves, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar is transformed, <i>Realized</i>, but she's not as excited as you might have imagined. She looks down at herself, and then back at you."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm... feeling mixed about this."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "On the one hand, alive and human, so yay."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "But on the other..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Skylar grasps her own glasses in her hands."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/46
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I'm useless now."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not useless - now you can make more dateviators, right?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Useless isn't bad. I'm useless too."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're useless!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I don't think so. I'm not an inventor... just good at making connections."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But Franklin has the plans still! We can ask him!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "We'll have to see how it goes on the outside..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "No. No you're not useless. Don't say that."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You've brought a whole lot of love into this world."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Harsh."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "But it is how I feel."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "We'll see what it's like out there..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's open the door and see..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_realized/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "One quickie before we go?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's nothing quick about your time with Skylar—she takes her time with you, savoring every touch, every breath, every sensation."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_love_divert/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But though she leaves you breathless and satisfied, she seems distractingly focused on one thing in particular..."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_love_divert/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your eyes. They seem to truly enthrall her. In the moments that you're not enraptured by her touch, you notice just how locked onto your gaze she is."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_love_divert/30
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I... can't look away."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_love_divert/41
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But even still, Skylar is Skylar. Despite her fascination with your eyes she leaves no part of you neglected. She wasn't kidding when she said she loves Love... and she is absolutely incredible at making it."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/skylar_love_join/0
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Before I go... let me just stick one last portrait on the bulletin board."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/4
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Woo woo. We did it! We brought a dateable object to life! <w>YAS!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "...sorry."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/23
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "How do you feel? Is it tingly?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you sure there's no moral implications to this?"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was mid."
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I thought so too!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "At first I was nervous but I hid it under my bubbly exterior!"
msgstr ""

#: skylar_specs/realize_cheer_1/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
